# ⚡ Spark AI Sidekick

Welcome to **Spark AI Sidekick**, a custom, multi-user web application connected to high-speed cloud intelligence! Designed with a beautiful custom interface, this application provides an isolated, smart chat environment for anyone who visits the web link.

## 🚀 Key Features

*   **🔒 Multi-User Privacy Architecture:** Every user who visits the site gets their own private session. Chats are isolated, meaning friends can talk to Spark simultaneously without ever seeing or overwriting your conversations.
*   **💾 Automatic Local Session Saving:** Your chat logs automatically synchronize to your active browser runtime session state. Even if you run tests, your dialogue history remains completely preserved until you explicitly clear it.
*   **🎙️ Hybrid Voice + Chat Mode:** Toggle between typing your messages or using live voice recognition to speak directly to Spark!
*   **📥 Active Log Exporter:** A dedicated settings panel built into the sidebar lets users instantly download their entire chat transcript as a clean `.txt` document with one click.
*   **⚡ Supercharged Engine:** Powered by the ultra-fast, up-to-date cloud model framework (`llama-3.1-8b-instant`).

## 🛠️ How to Use It

1.  **Start Chatting:** Simply open the web link, navigate to the text bar at the bottom, and start typing or speaking to Spark.
2.  **Voice Mode:** Look for the "Voice Mode Input" area in the side panel or below the screen to activate your device microphone.
3.  **Back Up History:** At any time during your session, open the left sidebar settings panel and click **📥 Download My Chat Log** to save a hard copy to your device.
4.  **Reset:** If you want to purge your history and start a totally fresh conversation, click the **🗑️ Reset My Chat Only** button inside the sidebar.
